# 4v4 test (docs/FOUR_ON_FOUR_PLAN.md section 8): Head to Head, Penalties ON, line changes On,
# 10-min periods (menu as long_penalties.input), then ~18k frames of seeded pseudo-random input
# for 8 seats, the Full 4v4 preset order:
#   NHL94_FORMAT=4v4 NHL94_SEATS=home:C,away:C,home:LW,away:LW,home:LD,away:LD,home:G,away:G
# Every 60-140 frames three random seats change direction and sometimes tap C (check: draws
# penalties), B (pass / call for pass) or A (shoot). Fixed seed 4404 (< 4096 directives).
